; Iter 227 / Fun Ideas Team — Ritual Pact Altar. Counterpart to the
; iter-33 stat shrine. Where a shrine grants a pure boon, this altar
; offers a boon + a per-run curse. Player picks ONE per shrine room:
; safe shrine prayer OR risky pact bargain.
;
; All visuals (plinth, obelisk, rune, glow, labels) are code-built in
; pact_altar.gd so adding a new pact entry stays a single-file edit on
; the script's PACT_CATALOG array. The CollisionShape2D is also code-
; built so the radius is governed by INTERACT_RADIUS.

[node name="PactAltar" type="Area2D"]
collision_layer = 0
collision_mask = 2
monitorable = false
script = ExtResource("1_script")
